    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense, but I don't really have time for another round of deep behavioral probing right now. I need to make a call on whether to pass him to the VP today. Based on the transcripts you've already processed, don't you think his preference for structure and collaboration might actually slow us down? Is there anything in his profile that suggests he can handle the chaos of our current pace?",
